    "Sticker packs are public and aren’t reviewed by White Noise. Your installed packs are listed publicly on your relays." : {
      "comment" : "Disclosure about public, unreviewed sticker packs and the public installed list.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sticker-Pakete sind öffentlich und werden von White Noise nicht geprüft. Deine installierten Pakete sind öffentlich auf deinen Relays aufgeführt."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Los paquetes de stickers son públicos y White Noise no los revisa. Tus paquetes instalados aparecen públicamente en tus relés."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Les packs d’autocollants sont publics et ne sont pas vérifiés par White Noise. Vos packs installés sont listés publiquement sur vos relais."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "I pacchetti di sticker sono pubblici e non vengono verificati da White Noise. I pacchetti installati sono elencati pubblicamente sui tuoi relay."
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Os pacotes de figurinhas são públicos e não são revisados pelo White Noise. Seus pacotes instalados ficam listados publicamente nos seus relays."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Наборы стикеров публичны и не проверяются White Noise. Установленные наборы публично указаны на ваших ретрансляторах."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Çıkartma paketleri herkese açıktır ve White Noise tarafından incelenmez. Yüklü paketleriniz rölelerinizde herkese açık olarak listelenir."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "贴纸包是公开的，未经 White Noise 审核。你已安装的贴纸包会公开列在你的中继上。"
