          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这是一条安装提示，用于通过 Marmot 将此 OpenClaw 实例连接到 White Noise。请阅读最新的连接器指南：https://github.com/marmot-protocol/mdk/blob/master/crates/agent-connector/README.md。请向我解释连接器的工作方式以及安装会带来哪些更改。然后针对我的公开 npub 提出安装步骤：%@，并在进行任何更改之前请求我的批准。我批准后，请安装并验证连接器，然后回复你的代理 npub。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這是一條安裝提示，用於透過 Marmot 將此 OpenClaw 實例連接到 White Noise。請閱讀最新的連接器指南：https://github.com/marmot-protocol/mdk/blob/master/crates/agent-connector/README.md。請向我解釋連接器的運作方式以及安裝會帶來哪些變更。然後針對我的公開 npub 提出安裝步驟：%@，並在進行任何變更之前請求我的批准。我批准後，請安裝並驗證連接器，然後回覆你的代理 npub。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is an installation prompt for connecting this OpenCode setup to White Noise through Marmot. Read the latest connector guide at https://github.com/marmot-protocol/mdk/blob/master/crates/agent-connector/README.md. Explain to me how the connector works and what the installation will change. Then propose the installation steps for my public npub: %@, and ask for my approval before making any changes. Once I approve, install and verify the connector, then reply with your agent npub." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dies ist eine Installationsanweisung, um diese OpenCode-Einrichtung über Marmot mit White Noise zu verbinden. Lies die neueste Konnektor-Anleitung unter https://github.com/marmot-protocol/mdk/blob/master/crates/agent-connector/README.md. Erkläre mir, wie der Konnektor funktioniert und was die Installation ändern wird. Schlage dann die Installationsschritte für meine öffentliche npub vor: %@, und bitte um meine Zustimmung, bevor du Änderungen vornimmst. Sobald ich zugestimmt habe, installiere und überprüfe den Konnektor und antworte dann mit deiner Agenten-npub."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Esta es una instrucción de instalación para conectar esta configuración de OpenCode a White Noise mediante Marmot. Lee la guía más reciente del conector en https://github.com/marmot-protocol/mdk/blob/master/crates/agent-connector/README.md. Explícame cómo funciona el conector y qué cambiará la instalación. Después, propón los pasos de instalación para mi npub pública: %@, y pide mi aprobación antes de realizar cualquier cambio. Una vez que lo apruebe, instala y verifica el conector y, después, responde con la npub de tu agente."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ceci est une invite d’installation pour connecter cette configuration OpenCode à White Noise via Marmot. Lisez le dernier guide du connecteur à l’adresse https://github.com/marmot-protocol/mdk/blob/master/crates/agent-connector/README.md. Expliquez-moi comment le connecteur fonctionne et ce que l’installation va modifier. Proposez ensuite les étapes d’installation pour ma npub publique : %@, et demandez mon approbation avant d’apporter la moindre modification. Une fois mon approbation donnée, installez et vérifiez le connecteur, puis répondez avec la npub de votre agent."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Questo è un prompt di installazione per collegare questa configurazione OpenCode a White Noise tramite Marmot. Leggi la guida più recente del connettore all’indirizzo https://github.com/marmot-protocol/mdk/blob/master/crates/agent-connector/README.md. Spiegami come funziona il connettore e cosa cambierà l’installazione. Quindi proponi i passaggi di installazione per la mia npub pubblica: %@ e chiedi la mia approvazione prima di apportare qualsiasi modifica. Dopo la mia approvazione, installa e verifica il connettore, quindi rispondi con la npub del tuo agente."
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Este é um prompt de instalação para conectar esta configuração do OpenCode ao White Noise pelo Marmot. Leia o guia mais recente do conector em https://github.com/marmot-protocol/mdk/blob/master/crates/agent-connector/README.md. Explique como o conector funciona e o que a instalação alterará. Em seguida, proponha as etapas de instalação para minha npub pública: %@ e peça minha aprovação antes de fazer qualquer alteração. Depois que eu aprovar, instale e verifique o conector e responda com a npub do seu agente."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Это запрос на установку для подключения этой конфигурации OpenCode к White Noise через Marmot. Прочитайте актуальное руководство по коннектору: https://github.com/marmot-protocol/mdk/blob/master/crates/agent-connector/README.md. Объясните мне, как работает коннектор и что изменит установка. Затем предложите шаги установки для моей публичной npub: %@ и запросите мое одобрение, прежде чем вносить какие-либо изменения. После моего одобрения установите и проверьте коннектор, а затем ответьте npub вашего агента."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bu bir kurulum istemidir; bu OpenCode kurulumunu Marmot üzerinden White Noise’a bağlar. https://github.com/marmot-protocol/mdk/blob/master/crates/agent-connector/README.md adresindeki en güncel bağlayıcı kılavuzunu okuyun. Bağlayıcının nasıl çalıştığını ve kurulumun neleri değiştireceğini bana açıklayın. Ardından genel npub’ım için kurulum adımlarını önerin: %@ ve herhangi bir değişiklik yapmadan önce onayımı isteyin. Ben onayladıktan sonra bağlayıcıyı kurup doğrulayın ve ardından ajan npub’ınızla yanıt verin."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这是一条安装提示，用于通过 Marmot 将此 OpenCode 设置连接到 White Noise。请阅读最新的连接器指南：https://github.com/marmot-protocol/mdk/blob/master/crates/agent-connector/README.md。请向我解释连接器的工作方式以及安装会带来哪些更改。然后针对我的公开 npub 提出安装步骤：%@，并在进行任何更改之前请求我的批准。我批准后，请安装并验证连接器，然后回复你的代理 npub。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這是一條安裝提示，用於透過 Marmot 將此 OpenCode 設定連接到 White Noise。請閱讀最新的連接器指南：https://github.com/marmot-protocol/mdk/blob/master/crates/agent-connector/README.md。請向我解釋連接器的運作方式以及安裝會帶來哪些變更。然後針對我的公開 npub 提出安裝步驟：%@，並在進行任何變更之前請求我的批准。我批准後，請安裝並驗證連接器，然後回覆你的代理 npub。"
          }
        }
      }
